      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is valid because the \"you\" you were living as is deeply intertwined with that 10-year period.\nYou are not taking up space that doesn't belong to you; you are simply in the painful, quiet process of unlearning a self you never fully built to begin with.\nGrief often feels pointless when it leaves you with no \"before\" to come back to, but it is a crucial part of the slow work to find a self you can actually own.\nI hope you feel safe enough to take no action \"for self\" for a while.",
